OL,3,AUK believes Iran involved in RAF
OL,4,AFairford incident, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government believes that Iran
OL,7,Fplayed a part in the RAF Fairford
OL,8,Fincident which resulted in five men
OL,9,Fbeing arrested and then bailed, Prime
OL,10,FMinister Andy Burnham has said.
OL,12,F"There are strong indications that Iran
OL,13,Fplayed a part in what happened over the
OL,14,Fweekend at RAF Fairford," he told the
OL,15,FBBC. He did not provide further
OL,16,Fdetails.
OL,18,FIran has responded, with Foreign
OL,19,FMinister Abbas Araghchi saying the UK
OL,20,Fleader was "barking up the wrong tree".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
